  "referenceNumber": "RUS1428",
  "remarks": "\n Radioavionica JSC is a company that carries out Research & Development, production and technological work for the Russian railways and produces reconnaissance, control and communications equipment for Russian military personnel. Radioavionica JSC therefore is or has been involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia by carrying on business in sectors of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, namely the transport and defence sectors. \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
